3. HOW TO REQUEST PERMISSION
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Email:    ranslyh@gmail.com
Subject:  "Khasi NLP Explorer — data use request"

In your message, please include:

  •  Your name, affiliation, and country.
  •  A clear description of what you want to do with the Protected
     Data (research, product, training corpus, etc.).
  •  Whether the use is commercial or non-commercial.
  •  Whether you intend to redistribute any derivative work, and if
     so, under what terms.
  •  An estimate of the volume of data you need (whole lexicon, a
     subset, specific recordings, etc.).
  •  Your contact email for follow-up correspondence.

The project lead will reply within a reasonable timeframe — typically
within two weeks — with one of: an approval (often with attribution
requirements and licence terms specific to your use), a request for
more information, or a decline. Most academic and non-profit requests
are approved; commercial requests are reviewed individually.

